# Zama FHEVM Cursor Rule

For full workflow, see [SKILL.md](../../SKILL.md).
For errors and fixes, see [error-reference.md](../../references/error-reference.md).
For fhevm-contracts full API, see [oz-confidential.md](../../references/oz-confidential.md).

## Activation

Apply this rule when working with:
- FHEVM, Zama Protocol, confidential smart contracts
- `euint64`, `ebool`, `eaddress`, `externalEuint64`, `einput`, or similar encrypted types
- `FHE.add`, `FHE.select`, `FHE.fromExternal`, `FHE.allowThis`, `FHE.allow`
- `TFHE.add`, `TFHE.select`, `TFHE.asEuint64`, `TFHE.allowThis`, `TFHE.allow`
- `@fhevm/hardhat-plugin`, `@zama-fhe/relayer-sdk`, `fhevmjs`
- `ConfidentialERC20`, `ConfidentialERC20Votes`, `EncryptedErrors`, `ERC-7984`, `fhevm-contracts`

