## Two Package Families — Pick the Right One

**Do not mix.** Wrong namespace or config class = compile error or silent wrong-network routing.

| | Standalone (`@fhevm/solidity`) | `fhevm-contracts` extension |
|---|---|---|
| Namespace | `FHE` | `TFHE` |
| Input type | `externalEuint64` | `einput` |
| Verify input | `FHE.fromExternal(enc, proof)` | `TFHE.asEuint64(enc, proof)` |
| ACL | `FHE.allowThis` / `FHE.allow` | `TFHE.allowThis` / `TFHE.allow` |
| Sepolia config (upcoming) | `SepoliaFHEVMConfig` | `SepoliaZamaFHEVMConfig` |
| Sepolia import (upcoming) | `@fhevm/solidity/config/FHEVMConfig.sol` | `fhevm/config/ZamaFHEVMConfig.sol` |
| Mainnet config (v0.11.1) | `ZamaEthereumConfig` | — |
| Mainnet import (v0.11.1) | `@fhevm/solidity/config/ZamaConfig.sol` | — |

> **v0.11.1 note:** The published npm package (`@fhevm/solidity@0.11.1`) may use `ZamaConfig.sol` instead of `FHEVMConfig.sol`. Run `ls node_modules/@fhevm/solidity/config/` to see which files exist in your installed version.

