## Common Mistakes Quick-Reference

| Mistake | Fix |
|---|---|
| `import hre from "hardhat"; hre.fhevm.xxx` | `import { fhevm } from "hardhat"` |
| `input.add64(n); const r = input.encrypt()` (split) | Fluent chain: `.add64(n).encrypt()` |
| `if (ebool) { ... }` | `FHE.select(cond, a, b)` |
| `euint64.unwrap(x) == 0` for init check | `!FHE.isInitialized(x)` |
| `einput` in standalone contract | `externalEuint64` + `bytes proof` |
| Missing `FHE.allowThis` after assignment | Add immediately after every `euintXX =` |
| Hardcoded ACL/KMS address | Inherit `SepoliaFHEVMConfig` or `ZamaEthereumConfig` |
| `@fhevm/hardhat-plugin` not first import | Move it to first line of `hardhat.config.ts` |
| `@fhevm/mock-utils` not installed | `npm install --save-dev @fhevm/mock-utils` |

